  "title": "Howmet Aerospace Inc. Announces Pricing of Debt Offering",
  "summary": "PITTSBURGH, Feb. 17, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Howmet Aerospace Inc. (“Howmet Aerospace” or the “Company”) (NYSE: HWM) today announced that it has priced its underwritten public offering of $400,000,000 aggregate principal amount of 3.750% notes due 2028 (the “2028 Notes”), $300,000,000 aggregate principal amount of 3.900% notes due 2029 (the “2029 Notes”) and $500,000,000 aggregate principal […]",
